WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.828
The right hand in the left hand.

2
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.630
And you're going to place it like a sword there,

3
00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:09.640
in the belly.

4
00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:15.800
Like this, here, there, exactly.

5
00:00:31.665 --> 00:00:34.125
To have control here over the hara.

6
00:00:55.515 --> 00:00:57.480
And you're going to start by breathing into your

7
00:00:57.520 --> 00:00:57.870
belly.

8
00:01:00.331 --> 00:01:03.211
So I'm going to take a breath, I'm going to exhale

9
00:01:03.251 --> 00:01:04.171
through my mouth, like this.

10
00:01:04.211 --> 00:01:06.741
I hold my breath for 10 seconds, on the exhale.

11
00:01:06.781 --> 00:01:08.561
And then, I inhale like that.

12
00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:10.891
Now, you need to practice this exercise 3 times,

13
00:01:10.931 --> 00:01:11.341
30 times.

14
00:01:11.381 --> 00:01:13.401
You'll have to increase it over time.

15
00:01:13.441 --> 00:01:15.401
You can go up to one to two minutes without

16
00:01:15.441 --> 00:01:16.232
breathing.

